    {
      "text": "Ambient oxygen is required during the high-temperature tests to enable oxidation.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature sliding causes rapid tribo-oxidation of the FeNiCrCoCu coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tribo-oxidation forms a continuous and adherent surface oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The surface layer may be a complex or spinel oxide.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film is self-passivating and acts as a barrier against further abrasive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film modifies the sliding interface and thereby reduces friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wear depth at 800–900 °C in air will be significantly lower than at room temperature.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::rubric_card::000::16e383e6c2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coefficient of friction at 800–900 °C will be lower than at room temperature.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::rubric_card::000::16e383e6c2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A distinct oxide phase will be present on high-temperature worn surfaces and absent or minimal after room-temperature testing.",
